        "content": "<p>in general not every frame hom is a Heyting hom, contrary to a TODO at <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Order/Hom/CompleteLattice.html\">Order.Hom.CompleteLattice</a> —would a PR deleting it &amp;/or adding a clarification be appropriate? the counterexample is fairly easy to construct, but i can also PR it to <code>Counterexamples</code>, if that made sense :)</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>Frame homs may not preserve complementation</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Topology</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Sets</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopologicalSpace</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">TopologicalSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TopologicalSpace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">compl_eq_interior_compl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">interior</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">ᶜ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"bp\">ᶜ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">occs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">])</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">compl_eq_sSup_disjoint</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">ext</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simp_rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">coe_interior</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">coe_sSup</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mem_setOf_eq</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mem_iUnion</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SetLike</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_coe</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exists_prop</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">interior</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">disjoint_iff</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"n\">coe_eq_empty</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">coe_inf</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">disjoint_iff_inter_eq_empty</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">subset_compl_iff_disjoint_right</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">hV</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hV'</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">use!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hV</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hV'</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨⟨</span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hV</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hV'</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">use!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">V</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hV</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hV'</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hU'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsClosed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Set</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">frameHom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"bp\">ᶜ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">frameHom</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">U</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">ᶜ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simpa</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">compl_eq_interior_compl</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Opens</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">frameHom_toFun</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">closure_eq_iff_isClosed</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>",
